{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026QNGLKe8DzR1795400881.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>朝鮮領袖金正恩稱，朝鮮不追求霸權和擴張。</p><p></p><p>朝中社報道，金正恩周日接受俄羅斯、巴西、印尼、瑞典等十個國家新任駐朝大使遞交的國書。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.NK.KIM-1000_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026cOGYjVOeQ41795400878.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>金正恩稱，目前的國際形勢和東亞政治軍事環境，要求朝鮮增強實力和能力，但朝鮮不追求霸權和擴張。他稱朝鮮內政工作的首要課題，是實現國家全面自主發展和經濟穩定增長。在對外政策方面，將以維護主權和安全為原則，秉持自主、和平與友好的理念，不斷拓展對外關係。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T03:28:59.667955+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T01:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T01:17:05.993833+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T03:22:25.566294+00:00","content_hash":"60c38b6e8aae0234f20a0cacec822426c6085d124279f410ec6a2941dfd78809","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T03:28:59.667955+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}